Terms of use
------------

These terms sit alongside CC BY 4.0. They are a request we ask users to
honour when they report results or train models.

1. Do not train models on the held-out test split, including paraphrases
   that preserve the item. The test split is not in this repository. When
   it is released it will be a zip that includes this canary, and it will
   not be published as plain text in the git history.
2. If you train on the test split anyway, say so in the model card and
   report it (open an issue on the MooreSense repository).
3. The public dev split may be used for research, development, error
   analysis, and published dev-set scores. State that those scores are on
   the public dev split.
4. Do not copy items from other benchmarks into MooreSense. Cite those
   projects for inspiration only.
5. No endorsement by Mooretech or the authors is implied by your use.

